*1 [[Crazed Tank Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Tank Cat]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
