*4 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is quite similar to [[Absolute Defense (Insane)|Absolute Defence]]. The Crazed Tank Cats are very vulnerable to being knocked back, and since they are not bosses, it is easily possible to knock them behind the enemy base and destroy it without having to chip away at the Tanks' high health. [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Recruit]] and [[Battle Items#Sniper The Cat|Sniper the Cat]] are quite valuable to bring from the small stage length. Also, at the beginning, remember to sync the Crazed Tanks' attacks so they don't plow through your defences as easily.

[[:Category:Super-Backliner-class Cats|Super-Backliners]] like [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] and [[Cat God the Great (Special Cat)|Cat God the Great]] can also work very well, as the Tanks are quite vulnerable to aggressive meatshield stalling. Keep your long-rangers well-protected to ensure victory.

===Recommended Ubers:===
As with Floor 30, 31, and 40, [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] units are the main stars of the show (i.e. [[Shadow Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Shadow Gao]], [[D'arktanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'arktanyan]], [[Lone Moon Lunos (Uber Rare Cat)|Lone Moon Lunos]]).

